comments.comment:
8eeb97e4:  .;
 .;This routine loads local configuration parameters for a package called DGJ1.
 .;It does some environment checks and sets up necessary variables.
 .;
 .;Post-initialization processes are also handled here,
 .;primarily some clean-up and removal of old data dictionary definitions.

32466b6c:  .;
 .;Entry point of the routine. This label is called to start initialization.
 .;
 .;Checks are done to ensure the key programming variables are properly defined.
 .;If any issues are found, control branches to ABRT to abort installation.

e4bd99a4:  .;
 .;This is the abort logic, executed if any checks fail.
 .;
 .;It sets the XPDABORT variable to flag the error condition.

1d357a66:  .;
 .;This is the post-initialization section.
 .;
 .;It cleans up old data dictionary definitions that are obsolete
 .;and no longer needed after the updated software is installed.
